    "Project B": {
      "Clarity of Value Proposition": "• Very clear – the problem (reaching for the mouse) and the solution (a wearable cursor controller) are immediately understandable.",
      "Market Size and Demand": "• Large – The target audience is broad and encompasses many professional and consumer groups. The need for ergonomic input solutions is significant.",
      "Feasibility and Development Plan": "• Strong – The project is already past the concept stage with prototypes, production partners, and compliance work underway. The roadmap is reasonably detailed.",
